; What a hosted package does with a map. `core`'s (`D-083`), re-exported.

(export (core:map:Map :as Map) (core:map:new :as map-new)
  (core:map:insert :as map-insert) (core:map:lookup :as map-lookup)
  (core:map:contains :as map-contains) (core:map:delete :as map-delete)
  (core:map:size :as map-size) (core:map:fold :as map-fold))
